and trying to make those be more consistent. Budgeting is very important when you're talking about, do I have enough money or not? And what is it that I think is needed? Do I need the luxury car or an economy car? There's choices that we make when people talk about money stress. Sometimes it's about covering the basics, but sometimes it's about what's my status with money

